          "nutrient": "sodium_mg",
          "kind": "max",
          "value": 2300
        }
      ],
      "notes": "Cap sodium at <2300 mg/d for T2D. Loses to the stricter KDIGO 2000 mg/d ceiling when CKD is present (see CONFLICT-SODIUM-CKD-WINS).",
      "url": "https://diabetesjournals.org/care",
      "verbatim_quote": "reduce sodium intake to less than 2,300 mg per day"
    },
    {
